// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2776785325" "Your luck has changed, {VillainName} and I'm going to tell you why.  I received some intel that pinpoints the location of President Marchand on this day back in 1963.  Apparently, he secured his entire building in St. Martial!  Hide in plain sight, I suppose.  So I'm going to send you back in time to put that final nail in his coffin.  <br><br><color orange>So your job is to break into the building and get Marchand</color>.  If you think the task will be simple, think again.  Marchand had many many supporters, both civilian and staff, who did not wish to see him ousted from his position.  If you can make your way past his men and get the key to the secure elevator, then you can get to him.  Please feel free to eliminate everything in your path.  Should you leave witnesses, well, now that would be bad for Lord Recluse, wouldn't it?<br><br><color orange>Note: This series of missions is recommended for group play. You're welcome to try it as a solo player, but it'll be tough. Consider yourself warned."
// AcceptString :
"P216763376" "Take out Marchand once and for all"
// SendOffString :
"P2943045979" "Have fun storming the presidential building!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3864984751" "Eliminate President Marchand"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3959566910" "I recommend that you take out all witnesses.  Ultimately, it's up to you.  But if you get lazy and are caught, I never knew you."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3944231360" "You cleverly piped gas into the building through some of the air ducts beforehand.  At least it'll knock a few of them out.<br><br>You can feel the hairs on the back of your neck stand on end as you enter the lobby of the Marchand building.  It's not every day you attempt to assassinate a president."

